    <bpmn:task id="task_snxp38pz" name="18. Engine comes with the plane" dai:notes="Drop the Engine category: Biplane = prop, Turboprop = turbo, Jet = jet. Remove mixed-engine art (jet pods on prop planes, prop on the jet) and prop-size limits. Loadout = style + paint + wheels (72 combos); ?plane=style.paint.wheels, old 4-part links still work. (design §8)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_gzgfhhnp</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_smw80fx5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_gzgfhhnp" sourceRef="task_07tcv09h" targetRef="task_snxp38pz" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_9q2fvc4u" name="19. Biplane +25% engine power" dai:notes="The biplane felt underpowered: raise its engine thrust by 25% (DEFAULT_SPEC.maxThrust 2600 → 3250 N; the prop engine&#39;s thrust-to-weight derives from it). Turboprop and jet unchanged. Keep composeSpec(default) === DEFAULT_SPEC. (design §8.2)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_smw80fx5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_r9z9st55</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_smw80fx5" sourceRef="task_snxp38pz" targetRef="task_9q2fvc4u" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_occljhoy" name="20. Route planner" dai:notes="Pure, testable game/route.ts: build the flight path from the home runway (take off into the wind) to a chosen destination airfield (land into the wind). Departure climb straight out, smooth curved cruise leg (no turns tighter than a gentle bank), straight-in final on a 4° glide slope to the threshold. Cruise altitude clears the terrain along the way with climb/descent rate limits. Airfield names from their bearing from home. Tests: every destination on many seeds, terrain clearance, turn radius, glide slope, ends on the runway." dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_r9z9st55</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_3im13sxj</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_r9z9st55" sourceRef="task_9q2fvc4u" targetRef="task_occljhoy" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_son5gpi7" name="21. 3D guide arrows" dai:notes="Transparent white chevron arrows placed along the route in 3D space, pointing along the path; only the stretch ahead of the plane is shown, fading in with distance; progress along the path tracked from the plane position. Visible from behind and above." dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_3im13sxj</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_hwi12com</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_3im13sxj" sourceRef="task_occljhoy" targetRef="task_son5gpi7" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_f7byx3za" name="22. Mission select &#38; route map" dai:notes="Main menu Mission choice: Free flight / Cross-country. Cross-country shows a destination picker (◀ name ▶, also ← → keys) and a map of the terrain with both airfields and the flight path, distance and estimated time. Saved in settings." dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_hwi12com</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_bkp9s4s6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_hwi12com" sourceRef="task_son5gpi7" targetRef="task_f7byx3za" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_no4tehb3" name="23. Cross-country mission logic &#38; verification" dai:notes="Sortie in route mode: arrows shown, objective with destination and distance, HUD marker toward the path when off it, route on the minimap. Success = landing at the destination; path-following accuracy shown in the debrief and part of the medal. Best record per seed + destination. Tests, tsc, build, browser check." dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_bkp9s4s6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_7q5zronu</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_bkp9s4s6" sourceRef="task_f7byx3za" targetRef="task_no4tehb3" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_5mr1icak" name="24. Flaps" dai:notes="Flaps for take-off and landing: lever with notches UP / T/O / LAND (F more, V less; gamepad d-pad). Flight model: extra lift (lower stall speed), extra drag at full flap, slightly earlier stall, trim change against ballooning, travel time, blow-back above each plane&#39;s flap speed. Animated flap surfaces on every airframe, FLAPS row on the HUD, tips at take-off and on approach. Tests: take-off run shorter with T/O flaps, slower touchdown with full flaps for every loadout; blow-back; steeper glide." dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_7q5zronu</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_quz8qbgw</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_7q5zronu" sourceRef="task_no4tehb3" targetRef="task_5mr1icak" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_8231a39k" name="25. Brakes +10% bite" dai:notes="Brake friction ×1.1 on every tyre (hard 0.605, medium 0.495, soft 0.418); DEFAULT_SPEC.brakeFriction 0.45 → 0.495 so composeSpec(default) === DEFAULT_SPEC. Every flight loadout still lands and stops without nosing over, with and without flaps. (design §8.2)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_quz8qbgw</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_li2t6iv8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_quz8qbgw" sourceRef="task_5mr1icak" targetRef="task_8231a39k" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_qk7cb8m0" name="26. Clearer FLAPS row on the HUD" dai:notes="Taller gauge panel with a divider between the throttle/rpm line and the flaps; &#39;(V ↔ F)&#39; key hint next to FLAPS; notches UP → T/O → LAND left to right; red &#39;TOO FAST — slow down!&#39; when blown back. Check in the browser." dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_li2t6iv8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_q44r7efh</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_li2t6iv8" sourceRef="task_8231a39k" targetRef="task_qk7cb8m0" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_obes8gsf" name="27. Six-pack instrument cluster" dai:notes="Three round steam gauges centre-bottom in flight, styled after insturments.png: left Airspeed Indicator (needle, km/h scale per plane, white flap arc, green normal, yellow caution, red line from each plane&#39;s stall/flap/max speeds), centre Attitude Indicator (sky/ground ball moving with pitch and rolling with bank, pitch ladder, bank scale, yellow fixed aircraft symbol), right Altimeter (100 and 1000 hands, digits 0–9, hatched low-alt flag). Landing glide-slope panel moved above the cluster. Scales down on narrow screens. Check in the browser. (design §3 HUD &#38; UI)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_q44r7efh</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_d2fb1enr</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_q44r7efh" sourceRef="task_qk7cb8m0" targetRef="task_obes8gsf" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_i1juquj8" name="28. Remove 3D cockpit gauges" dai:notes="Cockpit view: drop the three 3D gauges and the RPM needle from the dashboard mesh; the HUD instrument cluster replaces them. Keep the dashboard panel so the lower view still shows the cockpit. Check in the browser for all three planes." dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_d2fb1enr</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_v31d9nac</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_d2fb1enr" sourceRef="task_obes8gsf" targetRef="task_i1juquj8" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_v3nk7q0a" name="29. Modern Node &#38; npm for builds" dai:notes="Deploy build failed after the Vite 8 / Vitest 5 update: the lock file written by npm 11.6 left out optional @emnapi/* peers, and the host&#39;s npm 10 &#39;npm ci&#39; rejected it as out of sync. Pin Node 26.13.1 (npm 11) with .nvmrc / .node-version and package.json engines; regenerate the lock with npm 11.20 (includes the @emnapi entries); README requirement. Verify npm ci (npm 11 and 10), tests and build on a clean checkout." dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_v31d9nac</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_a5ogctmm</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_v31d9nac" sourceRef="task_i1juquj8" targetRef="task_v3nk7q0a" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_550ytawb" name="30. Fix white flashes in flight" dai:notes="After a page refresh and FLY!, the screen flashes full white now and then. Reproduce in the browser (per-frame whiteout value, overlay opacity, frame brightness), find the cause, fix it, and confirm no flashes on a fresh load." dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_a5ogctmm</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_cl5edggv</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_a5ogctmm" sourceRef="task_v3nk7q0a" targetRef="task_550ytawb" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_ffytomoq" name="31. Mobile-ready page &#38; lifecycle" dai:notes="index.html / style.css: viewport-fit=cover, safe-area insets, 100dvh, touch-action none on the canvas, no overscroll / pinch / double-tap zoom, seed input font ≥ 16 px. Web app manifest (fullscreen, landscape, icons). Fullscreen + orientation lock on FLY! where supported; &#39;Turn your phone sideways&#39; card pauses the sim in portrait. visibilitychange/pagehide → auto-pause + suspend audio, resume to the Pause screen; AudioContext resumed on first tap; optional Wake Lock while flying. (design §9.2 Mobile page, orientation &#38; fullscreen; Interruptions &#38; lifecycle)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_cl5edggv</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_b918numb</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="task_yjzfzje6" name="32. Touch input layer" dai:notes="src/core/touch.ts TouchControls: Pointer Events on the canvas with per-control pointer capture; pure layout + mapping (screen, safe areas, pointers → TouchState) so it unit-tests without a DOM. Floating stick (left half), throttle lever (right edge, double-tap idle), FLAPS ±, BRAKE hold, CAMERA, PAUSE, BAIL (hold 1 s, airborne only). Input.sample() merges it into ControlInput as manual input; auto-coordinated rudder and nose-wheel steering on touch; last-input-type tracking (touch vs keys/mouse/pad). Detect touch from the first touch pointer / (pointer: coarse), not the UA. Unit tests: Touch mapping unit test. No flight-model changes. (design §9.1 TouchControls, ADR: Touch control scheme, Rule: Touch uses the same ControlInput)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_b918numb</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_53hu5c3q</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_b918numb" sourceRef="task_ffytomoq" targetRef="task_yjzfzje6" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_ibjujnvg" name="33. On-screen flight controls &#38; tilt" dai:notes="Draw the touch controls on the HUD canvas in the ink style, semi-transparent, only while flying on touch; hide on key/mouse/pad input. Flap notch and throttle % / spool on the controls. Arcade assist by default on first touch play. Optional &#39;Steer by tilting&#39; in Pause: DeviceOrientation with iOS permission on tap, neutral captured at sortie start + Re-centre, ±25° full, 3° dead zone, low-pass; stick overrides tilt. Check in the browser with touch emulation. (design §9.1 Touch flight controls, Tilt steering)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_53hu5c3q</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_s444bi7j</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_53hu5c3q" sourceRef="task_yjzfzje6" targetRef="task_ibjujnvg" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_bgqvncfw" name="34. Responsive HUD &#38; instruments" dai:notes="HUD scale from the short side (text ≥ 11 px). Touch layout from TouchControls&#39; layout: six-pack centre-bottom between the thumb zones, glide-slope panel above, minimap/objective top-right under the safe area, compass top-centre; nothing under a control&#39;s resting area. Tips and HUD hints switch to touch wording when the last input was touch. Check at 667×375, 844×390 and 1180×820. (design §9.2 Responsive HUD &#38; instruments)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_s444bi7j</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_51wcoij3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_s444bi7j" sourceRef="task_ibjujnvg" targetRef="task_bgqvncfw" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_3axh0qdj" name="35. Touch-friendly menus, hangar &#38; route map" dai:notes="≥ 44×44 px targets, no hover-only states. Short-landscape main menu: title panel and flight plan side by side, scrolling inside panels; route map fits its column; destination picker swipes. Hangar: tappable tabs/cards, sideways-swiping card list on narrow screens, drag-to-rotate preview on touch. &#39;Controls&#39; shows the touch controls on touch devices. Pause and debrief reachable by thumb. (design §9.2 Touch-friendly menus &#38; hangar)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_51wcoij3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_9jk5y5kf</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_51wcoij3" sourceRef="task_bgqvncfw" targetRef="task_3axh0qdj" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_di6k95w8" name="36. Mobile quality tier" dai:notes="New &#39;mobile&#39; tier in TIERS: radius 3, no shadows, no edge-detect post (hulls only), maxPR 1.25, fewer clouds/particles, smaller chunk LRU; ≤ 2 chunk workers. Auto picks it for pointer: coarse + short side ≤ 900 px (replace the UA regex in pickTier). Frame cap 60, lower-rate menu rendering, pause rendering when hidden; dynamic resolution handles thermal throttling. Measure draw calls (≤ 150) and memory in mobile emulation with ?debug. (design §9.3 Mobile quality tier &#38; budget; Thermal throttling &#38; battery)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_9jk5y5kf</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_z9b8wmai</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_9jk5y5kf" sourceRef="task_3axh0qdj" targetRef="task_di6k95w8" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_tp1g3er9" name="37. Mobile tests &#38; verification" dai:notes="Touch mapping unit tests pass; all existing tests unchanged and green; tsc; production build. Mobile emulation smoke test in the browser (iPhone + Pixel viewports): tap FLY!, take off with lever + stick, fly 20 s, pause button, portrait card, no scroll/zoom, no console errors, Mobile tier chosen. Desktop regression: keyboard, mouse stick and gamepad unchanged, no touch controls shown. Real-device playtest checklist handed to the user (iPhone Safari + Home Screen, Android Chrome). (design §9.3 tests)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_z9b8wmai</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_4odqxe8m</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_z9b8wmai" sourceRef="task_di6k95w8" targetRef="task_tp1g3er9" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_cl5edggv" sourceRef="task_550ytawb" targetRef="task_ffytomoq" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_55o4fsch" name="38. Hide instrument cluster on mobile" dai:notes="On a phone the six-pack took ~50% of the screen height and hid the plane. Touch HUD: don&#39;t draw the instrument cluster; the status card under the pause button shows SPEED (km/h, red when stalled) and ALT/AGL instead, plus flaps and damage. Landing glide-slope panel sits low between the thumbs. Desktop unchanged. Check the frame at 667×375 and 844×390. (design §9.2 Responsive HUD &#38; instruments)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_4odqxe8m</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_nf5v4hnl</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_4odqxe8m" sourceRef="task_tp1g3er9" targetRef="task_55o4fsch" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_wrzm9l4q" name="39. Manifest &#38; app icons" dai:notes="Render 192, 512 and maskable 512 PNG icons from favicon.svg (maskable: full-bleed sky background, plane inside the safe zone). Manifest: id, display fullscreen with display_override, icons any + maskable, wide screenshot, categories. public/_headers: sw.js no-cache. (design §10 Install Baron as an app)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_nf5v4hnl</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_1k3vnb9r</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="task_arp2kyhm" name="40. Service worker &#38; offline" dai:notes="public-less build plugin in vite.config.ts emits sw.js with the precache list (all bundle files + public files) and a version hash. sw.js: precache on install, cache-first for precached, network-first navigation with cached fallback, stale-while-revalidate for Google Fonts, delete old caches, skipWaiting on message. src/core/pwa.ts registers it in production only. Unit test for the precache list. (design §10 Works offline, Service worker, ADR)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_1k3vnb9r</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_5ze4eqgf</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_1k3vnb9r" sourceRef="task_wrzm9l4q" targetRef="task_arp2kyhm" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_4b0hq1pa" name="41. Install button &#38; update prompt" dai:notes="Main menu: &#39;Install app&#39; button from beforeinstallprompt; iOS Safari tip &#39;Share → Add to Home Screen&#39;; hidden when running installed (display-mode / navigator.standalone). &#39;New version ready — Restart&#39; when a new service worker is waiting; restart = skipWaiting + reload on controllerchange, only from menus. (design §10 Install Baron as an app, App updates)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_5ze4eqgf</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_a3lko4tl</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_5ze4eqgf" sourceRef="task_arp2kyhm" targetRef="task_4b0hq1pa" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_l2mzu38v" name="42. PWA tests &#38; verification" dai:notes="tsc, tests, build. Production preview in the browser: service worker active, caches filled, manifest/icons valid; offline reload starts the game and flies; desktop and touch unchanged; no console errors. README note. (design §10 PWA install &#38; offline test)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_a3lko4tl</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_rqrd8zn1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_a3lko4tl" sourceRef="task_4b0hq1pa" targetRef="task_l2mzu38v" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_nf5v4hnl" sourceRef="task_55o4fsch" targetRef="task_wrzm9l4q" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_6gx8cq89" name="43. Remove the rotate card" dai:notes="Owner request: drop the &#39;Turn your phone sideways&#39; card and the portrait pause that came with it (a pause with no card would look frozen). Portrait mid-flight now just keeps flying. Removed the #rotate section, its CSS and the portrait check in Game.updateTouch. (design §9.2 Mobile page, orientation &#38; fullscreen)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_rqrd8zn1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_07jlf29z</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_rqrd8zn1" sourceRef="task_l2mzu38v" targetRef="task_6gx8cq89" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_i6pkr3dk" name="44. Design doc catch-up" dai:notes="Bring design.dai in line with what shipped: new §11 Cross-country missions (mission, route planner, guide arrows, route tests); §3 Flaps and Six-pack instrument cluster; HUD &#38; UI, Flight model, Controls (F/V flaps), Hangar &#38; briefing (no engine pick, mission choice), Settings &#38; saves, Debrief (path accuracy), Plane style (biplane 3250 N), Wheels (brakes ×1.1), Quality tiers (render-scale white-flash fix), Vite + TypeScript (Node 26.13.1 / npm 11 pin); mobile smoke test no longer expects the rotate card." dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_07jlf29z</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_hqy5dzzo</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_07jlf29z" sourceRef="task_6gx8cq89" targetRef="task_i6pkr3dk" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_r08m1dby" name="45. Esc is the only pause key" dai:notes="Owner request: remove the P (pause) and R (restart sortie) keyboard shortcuts; Esc pauses and resumes. Restart stays on the Pause menu&#39;s &#39;Restart sortie&#39; button; gamepad Start and the touch pause button unchanged. Controls table (index.html) and README updated. tsc + tests. (design §3 Controls &#38; input)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_hqy5dzzo</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_7qzw23yu</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_hqy5dzzo" sourceRef="task_i6pkr3dk" targetRef="task_r08m1dby" />
    <bpmn:task id="task_pur6z8jw" name="46. Number-key throttle only" dai:notes="Hacker News feedback: Ctrl (throttle down) collided with browser shortcuts — Ctrl+S opened Save, Ctrl+W (with W = pitch down) closed the tab. Remove the Shift/Ctrl throttle keys; the number row sets the throttle: 1 = idle, 2–9 in even steps, 0 = full (digitThrottle in src/core/input.ts). Gamepad and touch throttle unchanged. Take-off tip, controls table and README updated. Unit test for the mapping; tsc + tests. (design §3 Controls &#38; input)" dai:agentStatus="done">
      <bpmn:incoming>flow_7qzw23yu</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>flow_u2oxajsx</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_7qzw23yu" sourceRef="task_r08m1dby" targetRef="task_pur6z8jw" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="flow_u2oxajsx" sourceRef="task_pur6z8jw" targetRef="event_blqfau9s" />
